     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A clear and polite email",
     "texto": [
      "Start with a greeting and the reason: **Jeg vil melde fra om…** («I'd like to report…»). Describe what you have observed, since when and the effect. Close with a request: **Kan dere undersøke dette i løpet av uka?** («Could you check this during the week?»). Use **Vennlig hilsen** («Kind regards») before your name.",
      "Keep a neutral tone and separate fact from assumption. Add when someone is at home to make coordination easier."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
